WEBVTT

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:07.650
Radar observations near Skagen. Sentinel-1 observes radar reflections from the anchorage, including through cloud and darkness.

00:00:08.770 --> 00:00:14.210
The model uses current and earlier radar observations from the same orbit.

00:00:15.770 --> 00:00:23.130
The displayed grid also contains nine lower-score candidates. None has been matched to AIS.

00:00:24.250 --> 00:00:30.170
The image is not terrain-corrected. Predicted vessel attributes and positions need validation.
